    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31800" root="غزل" body-key="g">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغزل</span></b> , (K,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغزلت</span>, (S, O,) <i>He,</i> or <i>she,
turned round,</i> or <i>made to revolve,</i> [or rather
<i>twirled,</i>] <i>the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِغْزَل</span> [or <i>spindle</i>]: (S, O, K:) [or
so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغزل المغزلَ</span>, or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغزلتهُ</span>, for] one says of the
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مغزل</span> [or spindle], <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُغْزِلَ</span>, i. e. <i>it was turned round</i>
[or <i>twirled</i>]. (Fr, S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغزلت</span> <i>She</i> (a gazelle)
<i>had a young one.</i> (S, O. [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَزَالٌ</span>.])

